<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on December 12.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			    Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Schroder Intl	 10.02	2.40</p>
<p>2   Prime Credit Tr	9.90	0.99</p>
<p>3   Villa World	    9.65	1.14</p>
<p>4   Prop Income Inv	9.50	1.07</p>
<p>5   BT Prop Trust	  9.49	1.72</p>
<p>6   MT Leyshon Gold	9.33	2.68</p>
<p>7   Indu Property	  9.29	0.98</p>
<p>8   Aust Tour		9.15	0.82</p>
<p>9   Colonial Mutual	8.97	1.16</p>
<p>10  Centro Prop	    8.74	2.23</p>
<p>11  Gandel Retail Tr     8.67	0.90</p>
<p>12  Equitilink	     8.47	0.59</p>
<p>13  Gen Prop Tr	    8.38	2.40</p>
<p>14  Schroder Prop	  8.33	2.22</p>
<p>15  Barclays Mirvac	8.33	1.32</p>
